\fs72 \cf0  
\f1\b\fs44 Accessible Pakistan: A Disability Accessibility Management System
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl292\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs34 \cf0 1. What Your Project Aims to Achieve
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 The main aim of 
\f3\b Accessible Pakistan
\f2\b0  is to promote an inclusive, safe, and supportive environment for people with disabilities. The project aims to empower individuals with disabilities by providing reliable accessibility information about public places and facilities, allowing them to make informed decisions and access different locations independently, without unnecessary dependence on others.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 The system aims to create awareness about accessibility and encourage equal opportunities for everyone, regardless of their physical abilities.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl292\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs34 \cf0 2. What Problems It Will Solve
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 People with disabilities often face difficulties accessing public places because they lack information about available accessibility facilities.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 For example, a person who uses a wheelchair may want to visit a university, hospital, shopping mall, or restaurant but may not know whether the location has wheelchair ramps, elevators, accessible washrooms, or suitable pathways.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 Similarly, individuals with visual or hearing impairments may face difficulties when appropriate accessibility facilities are unavailable.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 Our system aims to address these problems by providing accessibility-related information about different public locations. This will help individuals identify suitable places according to their needs, plan their visits confidently, and reduce unnecessary dependence on others.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl292\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs34 \cf0 3. What the System Will Do and How It Will Behave
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 Accessible Pakistan will provide a platform where users can explore public places and check the accessibility facilities available at different locations.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 The system will:
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Allow users to search for public places such as universities, hospitals, shopping malls, restaurants, and other facilities.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Display accessibility information about each location.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Provide information about wheelchair ramps, elevators, accessible washrooms, parking facilities, and other relevant features.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Include accessibility information for people with visual and hearing impairments.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Allow users to share their experiences and provide feedback about the accessibility of different locations.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Allow administrators to manage location information and review submitted feedback.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tqr\tx300\tx540\li540\fi-540\sl324\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 Help users identify locations that meet their individual accessibility requirements.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 The system will respond to users\'92 searches by displaying relevant location information. If accessibility information is unavailable for a particular location, the system will clearly communicate that the information is currently unknown rather than presenting unverified details as facts.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl292\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs34 \cf0 4. What Scenarios and Situations It Will Handle
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 The system will handle different situations faced by people with disabilities.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs26 \cf0 Scenario 1: Wheelchair Accessibility
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 A wheelchair user wants to visit a university but does not know whether it has wheelchair ramps, elevators, or accessible washrooms. They can search for the university through Accessible Pakistan and check its available accessibility facilities before visiting.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs26 \cf0 Scenario 2: Accessibility for Visually Impaired People
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 A visually impaired person wants to visit a public building. They can explore the available information about facilities such as tactile pathways, accessible signs, and other visual accessibility support.
\f0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs26 \cf0 Scenario 3: Accessibility for Hearing Impaired People
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

